    },
    {
      "date": "1888-11-09",
      "headline": "Murder of Mary Jane Kelly",
      "text": "Mary Jane Kelly, the fifth and final canonical victim, was found brutally murdered in her room at 13 Miller's Court, Dorset Street, Spitalfields. Her body was extensively mutilated."
    },
