      "date": "1937-12-13",
      "headline": "Start of the Nanjing Massacre",
      "text": "The mass murder and atrocities against Chinese civilians and disarmed soldiers began as Japanese troops took control of the city."
    },
    {
      "date": "1937-12-15",
      "headline": "Mass Executions Begin",
      "text": "Japanese soldiers began systematic mass executions of Chinese prisoners of war and civilians, with thousands killed in the first few days."
