      "text": "Mossad provided intelligence support for Operation Entebbe, a successful rescue mission by Israeli commandos to free hostages held at Entebbe Airport in Uganda."
    },
    {
      "date": "1981-06-07",
      "headline": "Operation Opera",
      "text": "Mossad played a role in gathering intelligence for Operation Opera, an Israeli airstrike that destroyed the Osirak nuclear reactor in Iraq."
