    {
      "date": "1997-09-25",
      "headline": "Failed Assassination Attempt in Jordan",
      "text": "Mossad agents attempted to assassinate Khaled Mashal, a Hamas leader, in Amman, Jordan. The operation failed, leading to diplomatic tensions between Israel and Jordan."
    },
    {
