    },
    {
      "date": "2019-05-31",
      "headline": "Release of 'Godzilla: King of the Monsters'",
      "text": "This film, part of the MonsterVerse, featured Godzilla battling iconic monsters like King Ghidorah, Mothra, and Rodan."
    },
    {
