      "headline": "Treaty of Utrecht",
      "text": "The Treaty of Utrecht ended the War of the Spanish Succession, with significant territorial and political consequences for France and Europe."
    },
    {
      "date": "1715-09-01",
      "headline": "Death of Louis XIV",
      "text": "Louis XIV died at the age of 76 at the Palace of Versailles, after a reign of 72 years, the longest of any major European monarch."
    }
  ]
}

