      "text": "Nero was born as Lucius Domitius Ahenobarbus in Antium, Italy, to Gnaeus Domitius Ahenobarbus and Agrippina the Younger."
    },
    {
      "date": "0050",
      "headline": "Adoption by Emperor Claudius",
      "text": "Nero was adopted by his great-uncle, Emperor Claudius, making him the heir to the Roman Empire."
