      "text": "During his military campaigns, Marcus Aurelius began writing 'Meditations,' a series of personal writings reflecting his Stoic beliefs and philosophy."
    },
    {
      "date": "0180",
      "headline": "Death of Marcus Aurelius",
      "text": "Marcus Aurelius, Roman Emperor and Stoic philosopher, died. His work 'Meditations' remains one of the most significant texts on Stoic philosophy."
    },
    {
