      "date": "1814-12-24",
      "headline": "Treaty of Ghent Signed",
      "text": "The Treaty of Ghent was signed by American and British representatives in Ghent, Belgium, effectively ending the War of 1812. The treaty restored pre-war boundaries but did not address the issues that initially caused the war."
    },
    {
      "date": "1815-01-08",
      "headline": "Battle of New Orleans",
      "text": "American forces under General Andrew Jackson defeated the British at the Battle of New Orleans. The battle occurred after the Treaty of Ghent was signed but before it was ratified, making it the last major battle of the war."
