      "headline": "International Morse Code Standardized",
      "text": "The International Telegraph Union standardized Morse code, creating a version that was slightly different from the original American Morse code."
    },
    {
      "date": "1865",
      "headline": "Adoption by International Telegraph Union",
      "text": "The International Telegraph Union adopted the International Morse Code as the standard for international communication."
    },
    {
